# The source distribution on PyPI (0.94.4): the package, its data, the tests (0.99.37: no PDS products - the tests fetch
# them, see tests/conftest.py), and the
# documents a reviewer looks for. The studies, notebooks, Windows scripts, paper and documentation site stay in the
# git repository (https://github.com/ctate7163/rpp).
include LICENSE NOTICE README.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CONTRIBUTING.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md pyproject.toml
graft src/rpp/data
recursive-include tests *.py
graft tests/data
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store
prune studies
prune notebooks
prune paper
prune docs
prune scripts
prune envs
prune "Claude outputs"
